  "bodyHash": "907d1db1e9655d13",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Hoe Tweaks 針對鋤頭工具進行了多項生活品質（QoL）調整。所有設定皆可自訂。加快採收作物方塊（南瓜/西瓜）的速度，支援翻耕與解除翻耕土壤，並依材質等級（如木質、鑽石）擴大翻耕範圍。預設需蹲下才能啟用擴大的翻耕範圍。<br><br>使用擴大範圍時，每多翻耕一個方塊都會消耗耐久。系統已將「耐久」附魔納入計算。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum&#x27;s QoL 套件\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可自訂設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>onlyUntillWithOtherHandEmpty</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，僅在其他手空著時允許執行解除翻耕功能。這讓您可以手持鋤頭時放置種子。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>cropBlockBreakSpeedModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：8.0，最小值：0.0，最大值：20.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">作物方塊（南瓜/西瓜）的破壞速度比預設快多少倍。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustCrouchToHaveBiggerHoeRange</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否僅在玩家右鍵點擊中心方塊且處於蹲下狀態時，才啟用擴大的鋤頭範圍。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>woodenTierHoeRange</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：0，最小值：0，最大值：32</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">木製鋤頭的翻耕範圍（蹲下時的預設值）。0 = 1x1</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>stoneTierHoeRange</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：1，最小值：0，最大值：32</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">石製鋤頭的翻耕範圍（蹲下時的預設值）。1 = 3x3</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>goldTierHoeRange</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：2，最小值：0，最大值：32</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">金製鋤頭的翻耕範圍（蹲下時的預設值）。2 = 5x5</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ironTierHoeRange</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：2，最小值：0，最大值：32</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">鐵製鋤頭的翻耕範圍（蹲下時的預設值）。2 = 5x5</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>diamondTierHoeRange</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：3，最小值：0，最大值：32</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">鑽石鋤頭的翻耕範圍（蹲下時的預設值）。3 = 7x7</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>netheriteTierHoeRange</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：4，最小值：0，最大值：32</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">獄髓鋤頭的翻耕範圍（蹲下時的預設值）。4 = 9x9</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>加快採收南瓜與西瓜：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hoe-tweaks/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"554\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>使用鑽石鋤頭進行翻耕與解除翻耕，預設範圍為 7x7：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hoe-tweaks/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"550\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>另一個使用石製鋤頭的範例，範圍為 3x3。右鍵點擊已翻耕的方塊即可解除翻耕：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hoe-tweaks/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 平台內，您即可在任何整合包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽與更多詳細資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於無法在眾多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤評論，因此已關閉留言功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 存放庫</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
